+## Sales and variance
+
+- Each imported till sale (`ticket`, `soldAt`, `dishId`, `qty`) consumes `qty`
+  portions of the dish's recipe at `soldAt` with ledger `ref` `sale:<ticket>`.
+- Tickets already imported are skipped; an invalid row or insufficient stock
+  aborts the whole CSV import.
+- Usage variance over `[from, to]` compares theoretical recipe consumption from
+  sales sold in those UTC days against actual `consume` movements in those days.
